        "id": "blaze",
        "name": "Blaze"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Imperius's mobility is one of his greatest weaknesses, consequently, he pairs extremely well with Heroes like Jaina or Fenix that can slow enemies, so Imperius can catch them up with Celestial Charge. On the other hand, Heroes like Mal'Ganis or E.T.C. that can keep enemies in place are even better, because Imperius is very dependent on hitting his Charge, and a sleeping or stunned enemy is a guaranteed hit. Furthermore, as a tank, Imperius requires another resistant Hero in the frontline that can compensate for his lack of peel, like Yrel or Blaze."
  },
