    "explanation": "Imperius falls slightly behind other Offlaners when it comes to waveclear and capturing Mercenary Camps, however, he excels in team fights due to his high damage and sustain. For those reasons, Imperius performs better on Maps where it is not possible to double soak and there are not too many Mercenary Camps."
